# FS AI — Pages security headers (2026-11-22 autonomy fix, item 3).
# Audit (22 Nov): the site loads exactly ONE external resource — the GA4
# script from www.googletagmanager.com. No external stylesheets or fonts,
# no images, no iframes or embeds. Fetches go only to the Worker
# (https://fs-ai.mdalfahad841.workers.dev) and to this origin. GA4 beacons go
# to www.google-analytics.com. The CSP ships REPORT-ONLY first: nothing is
